{{## Idiomatic Scriban -- fragment-heavy price partial.

     Patterns followed, from Scriban's own documentation:
       language          https://github.com/scriban/scriban/blob/master/doc/language.md
       builtins/html     https://github.com/scriban/scriban/blob/master/doc/builtins.md#html-functions
       runtime/includes  https://github.com/scriban/scriban/blob/master/doc/runtime.md

     Renders the display price from the scope-shared row's promo: the whole-currency int plus
     the literal `.99` -- the template composes display text, the model carries data.
     Checked by the functional verifier, not the byte gate. Note the multi-line comment
     delimiters: the single-line form ends at the first newline, which would leave the doc
     URLs to parse as expressions. ##}}

<p class="price">{{ item.promo.price }}.99</p>
